{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53935","headline":"五言述瓜沙（一下有「州」字）僧献款诗一首 · 彦楚","name":"五言述瓜沙（一下有「州」字）僧献款诗一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡邑虽然异，衔恩万国同。\n远朝来凤阙，归顺贺宸聪。\n昌（疑应作「冒」字）暑闻莺啭，看花落晚红。\n辩清能击论，学富早成功。\n大教从西得，敷皂赐（一作「筵愿」）向东。\n今朝承圣旨，起坐沐天风。\n（同前。\n注「一作」者，爲伯三七二○卷之异文。\n原署：「右街崇先寺内讲论兼应制大德彦楚。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彦楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}